1
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:25,166
Who the hell are you?

2
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,125
Weren’t you the
ones who summoned me?

3
00:00:30,041 --> 00:00:31,750
You… you’re the Godfather?

4
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:33,250
I’m here.

5
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:34,666
Say your last words.

6
00:00:37,125 --> 00:00:38,166
Last words?

7
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:40,125
I’ve got your
wife’s father right here.

8
00:00:40,125 --> 00:00:42,000
Call off your forces now,

9
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,916
- or I slit his throat!
- My lord, don't worry about me!

10
00:00:45,375 --> 00:00:46,625
Shut up!

11
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,250
Go ahead.

12
00:00:49,041 --> 00:00:53,750
If he dies, I inherit
the entire Morellan family anyway.

13
00:00:53,750 --> 00:00:55,041
Are you freaking crazy?

14
00:00:55,041 --> 00:00:57,666
Do I look like I’m joking?

15
00:00:57,666 --> 00:01:00,541
Oh, by the way,
I brought you a gift.

16
00:01:04,625 --> 00:01:05,875
Your master.

17
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:07,750
Already dead.

18
00:01:08,166 --> 00:01:09,666
Take him if you want.

19
00:01:09,750 --> 00:01:12,791
You killed the Black Dragon Lord?!

20
00:01:13,250 --> 00:01:14,916
I’ll make you all pay!

21
00:01:15,541 --> 00:01:16,291
Hold on.

22
00:01:16,625 --> 00:01:21,041
Before you die, let me
show you one more thing.

23
00:01:24,875 --> 00:01:26,125
You bastard!

24
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:27,666
- Help!
- Help!

25
00:01:28,125 --> 00:01:29,416
- Save us!
- Save us!

26
00:01:31,125 --> 00:01:33,875
You threaten my family
and call me despicable?

27
00:01:33,875 --> 00:01:34,500
Fine.

28
00:01:35,250 --> 00:01:38,250
I'll play your game, but dirtier.

29
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,625
One word from me,

30
00:01:41,625 --> 00:01:44,750
and your family suffers worse than death.

31
00:01:47,916 --> 00:01:50,916
Please… spare my family.

32
00:02:05,416 --> 00:02:06,666
My lord!

33
00:02:06,666 --> 00:02:07,833
Father!
